  "$comment": "Package @seed-lab. Purpose: workspace member manifest. Why: separate installable unit under packages/*. Invariant: private, type module, test via node --test. trace:v1 id=impl.pkg-seed-lab work=WORK-SEED-6VF90M7B satisfies=REQ-SEED-EZPD6B85",
